# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# مِسبار (Misbar) — environment template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app currently needs NO environment variables: it is a static
# Vite + React site and all student progress stays in the browser's
# localStorage (nickname + avatar only, no personal data).
#
# How to use (only if a future feature needs a setting):
#   1. Copy this file to `.env.local`   (cp .env.example .env.local)
#   2. Fill in the values in `.env.local` — that file is git-ignored.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite exposes every variable that starts with VITE_ to the
# browser bundle, so a VITE_ variable is PUBLIC. Never put passwords,
# private API keys or service-role keys in any VITE_ variable, and never
# commit real values to this template.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# (no variables required yet)
